IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pvpa-protection`

-- Plant Varieties Protection Act 2004, ss 2, 10, 11, 14, 21, 22, 24 to 32, 34, 36, 44 to 46, 48, 52 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_plant-varieties-protection-act-2004.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a Singapore nursery sale 10 months before` MEANS Sale WITH
    `in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `months before the Singapore application` IS 10
    `by or with the breeder's consent for exploitation` IS TRUE
    `under a stock-increase or testing arrangement` IS FALSE
    `of material neither propagating nor harvested` IS FALSE
    `of surplus breeding material sold unidentified for consumption` IS FALSE

